lspan="1">15.5 &#x000b1; 3.0<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ijn-4-027">b</xref></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.54 &#x000b1; 0.02<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ijn-4-027">a,b</xref></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.32 &#x000b1; 0.04</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Nanonized soy</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">8</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">30.45 &#x000b1; 0.47</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">31.77 &#x000b1; 3.42<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ijn-4-027">b</xref></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5.83 &#x000b1; 0.13</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.85 &#x000b1; 0.08<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ijn-4-027">a</xref></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.40 &#x000b1; 0.06<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ijn-4-027">a</xref></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">36.5 &#x000b1; 5.5<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ijn-4-027">a</xref></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.47 &#x000b1; 0.03<sup>c</sup></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.30 &#x000b1; 0.05</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Micro-soybean</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">8</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">31.06 &#x000b1; 0.74</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">33.09 &#x000b1; 3.69<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ijn-4-027">b</xref></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5.62 &#x000b1; 0.08</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.58 &#x000b1; 0.06<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ijn-4-027">a,b</xref></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.30 &#x000b1; 0.04<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ijn-4-027">a,b</xref></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20.0 &#x000b1; 5.5<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ijn-4-027">b</xref></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.50 &#x000b1; 0.02<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ijn-4-027">b</xref>,<sup>c</sup></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.31 &#x000b1; 0.04</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn2-ijn-4-027"><p><bold>Notes:</bold> Values are the mean &#x000b1; SEM and analyzed by mutifactorial analysis or one-way ANOVA.</p></fn><fn id="tfn3-ijn-4-027"><label><sup>a,b</sup></label><p>Data with different superscripts are significantly different at P &#x0003c; 0.05. Splenocytes (1 &#x000d7; 10<sup>6</sup> cells/ml) were cultured with RPMI-1640 complete medium and stimulated with LPS (1 &#x003bc;g/ml) or Con A (5 &#x003bc;g/ml) at 37 &#x000b0;C in a humidified incubator under 5% CO<sub>2</sub> for 48 h or 72 h. Proliferation was measured by MTT assay. Con A-stimulated cell culture supernatants were assayed for IFN-&#x003b3;, IL-2, IL-4, and IL-5 with respective murine cytokine ELISA kits.</p></fn><fn id="tfn4-ijn-4-027"><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> ANOVA, analysis of variance; Con A, concanavalin A; IFN, interferon; IL, interleukin; LPS, lipopolysaccharide; MTT, 3-(4,5-dimethylthiazol-2-yl)-2,5-diphenyltetrazolium bromide; SEM, standard error of mean.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>